# Shared .gitattributes for magicsunday/* projects. Copy to `.gitattributes` at
# the repo root and add repo-specific entries. Keeps the COMPOSER dist archive
# lean by export-ignoring dev-only tooling, tests and CI config.
#
# This has no effect on an npm package: npm never reads .gitattributes, not even
# for a `github:` git dependency. There, the `files` allow-list in package.json
# decides what ships (or `.npmignore`, if no `files` is given). A repo publishing
# to both therefore needs BOTH lists — export-ignore here, `files` there — and
# they have to be kept in step by hand.
#
# `/package.json` is export-ignored on the same footing as every other dev-only
# config: a Composer consumer installs the PHP package and never reads it, and
# export-ignore does not reach the npm side, so a repo publishing to both keeps
# its npm artefact regardless. A repo whose Composer package genuinely needs its
# package.json at runtime — none does today — drops the line and says why.
/.build                     export-ignore
# Export-ignoring /.github blinds OSSF Scorecard's file-based checks
# (Dangerous-Workflow, Token-Permissions, Pinned-Dependencies report `-1` = "not
# applicable", not a penalty), because Scorecard analyses the export-ignored
# source tarball rather than the checkout. Accepted trade-off: those checks are
# covered on the real checkout by zizmor + the CodeQL `actions` analysis, and
# Dependency-Update-Tool recovers via Scorecard's update-PR-activity fallback.
/.github                    export-ignore
/tests                      export-ignore
/.editorconfig              export-ignore
/.gitattributes             export-ignore
/.gitignore                 export-ignore
/.jscpd.json                export-ignore
/.php-cs-fixer.dist.php     export-ignore
/.phplint.yml               export-ignore
/AGENTS.md                  export-ignore
/biome.json                 export-ignore
/biome.jsonc                export-ignore
/infection.json5            export-ignore
/phpstan.neon               export-ignore
/phpstan-scripts.neon       export-ignore
/package.json               export-ignore
/package-lock.json          export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist           export-ignore
/rector.php                 export-ignore
/tsconfig.json              export-ignore
